    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31186" root="عير" body-key="E">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعايروا</span></b>  <i>They blamed, upbraided,</i> or <i>reproached, one another; found fault, one with
another; i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَايَبُوا</span>, (S, O, Msb,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيَّرَ بَعْضُهُمْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعْضًا</span>: (K:) or <i>they reviled,</i> or <i>vilified, one another;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسَابُّوا</span>. (AZ.)

